Note: features/aether/aether/ is a copy of the aether/ package from
https://github.com/InternRobotics/Aether (formerly OpenRobotLab/Aether), taken
via the VidFM3D copy (https://github.com/zxhuang1698/VidFM3D). It differs from
upstream in three places:
  1. aether/pipelines/aetherv1_pipeline_cogvideox.py, line 22: relative import
     (`from ..utils.preprocess_utils import imcrop_center`).
  2. aether/pipelines/aetherv1_pipeline_cogvideox.py, line 495: the video is
     preprocessed with resize_mode="default" instead of "crop".
  3. aether/utils/postprocess_utils.py: upstream lines 119-122 (wrapping a
     float `focal` in a NumPy array) are removed.
aether/utils/visualize_utils.py is not included.
